{#
  The public website's entry point — a dispatcher, not a design.

  The actual layout is chosen in theme.yml:

      board:
        web_layout: poster      # or chronicle / ember_terminal / codex

  ...and lives in templates/web/<name>.html.j2. A guild can drop its own
  layout in board_templates/web/ and name it here; an unknown name falls
  back to the shipped poster layout (see theme.resolve_templates), so a
  typo can never produce a blank site.

  Callers keep rendering "web.html.j2" exactly as before — swapping the
  layout is a theme.yml edit, never a code change.
#}
